OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Fthis evening and overnight, but a few
OL,7,Fshowers may move along the east coast
OL,8,Fat times. Clearing skies will lead to
OL,9,Fa chilly night, especially in the
OL,10,Fcountryside.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA dry and bright day with a
OL,13,Fmix of sunny spells and the odd
OL,14,Fcoastal shower. After a cool start,
OL,15,Ftemperatures climbing to around
OL,16,Faverage in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
